    br "The lasses are upstairs resting."
    scene ch4sc4_003 with dissolve
    mc "I was wondering when you'd show up, Flynn."
    mc "I see you two have hit it off?"
    scene ch4sc4_004 with dissolve
    fy "Hey cuz... I wish it was under better circumstances."
    fy "This fella explained everything."
    scene ch4sc4_005 with dissolve
    br "So... what’s the plan?"
