    mc "Flynn, I’m leaving at first light tomorrow... if you want to come, you can meet me at the docks. But think about it."
    mc "This isn’t like when we were kids... this is life or death. There’s no reason for you to risk your life as well."
    scene ch4sc4_014 with dissolve
    fy "Let me stop you right there, cousin. There’s no doubt in my mind that I'm doing this."
    scene ch4sc4_019 with dissolve
    fy "We thought we'd already lost you once. I’m going to make sure we don’t have a repeat of that."
    fy "We’re family. I was the one who had to stay strong when Alice and Sabby were crying their eyes out after you disappeared."
    scene ch4sc4_020 with dissolve
    fy "Some days things seemed normal... and then, suddenly out of nowhere, a memory of you would strike them."
    fy "Then they'd isolate themselves again, sobbing uncontrollably til their bodies couldn’t produce anymore tears."
    fy "We’ve all been through so much god damn pain and grief from losing you and your parents all those years ago."
    scene ch4sc4_019 with dissolve
    fy "So I’m doing this. And maybe I'm joking about the benefits, but they're {b}NOT{/b} why I’m doing it."
    fy "If you believe anything, believe that."
