    mc "And thank you, Borri. For staying behind and looking after Eliza."
    mc "It’s not a favor I will soon forget."
    scene ch4sc4_026 with dissolve
    br "Bah! Don't ye get all mushy on me now... go on, lad."
    br "But after ye return, the first two barrels o' ale will be on you."
